/*
 * Root validator for all unary operators in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Dispatch unary operator validation to the appropriate specialized module:
 *       • UnaryMinusValidation
 *       • UnaryAndValidation
 *       • UnaryStarValidation
 *       • UnaryNotValidation
 *   - Handle class unary operator overloading via validateClass().
 *   - Construct operator-override method accesses for class types.
 *   - Forward class unary operations to TemplateValidation and CallValidation.
 *
 * This module is the central entry point for validating unary expressions.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::unary
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/unary.yr
 * @Author(s):
